WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.890 --> 01:31.160
[My Journey to You]

01:31.190 --> 01:34.060
[Episode 8]

01:34.470 --> 01:35.090
Wait!

01:43.190 --> 01:45.390
What can I do for you, Young Master Ziyu?

01:47.440 --> 01:48.320
You can speak?

01:52.350 --> 01:54.009
She is my Green Jade Guardian.

01:54.110 --> 01:55.910
I asked her to prepare something

01:56.700 --> 01:57.610
so she's late.

02:05.020 --> 02:06.750
According to the ancestral precept of the Gong family,

02:06.750 --> 02:08.110
a personal Green Jade Guardian

02:08.110 --> 02:09.449
can be brought to complete the trials,

02:09.449 --> 02:10.030
right?

02:10.199 --> 02:12.400
But your Green Jade Guardian is Jin Fan.

02:14.110 --> 02:16.050
As the Gong family's Sword Wielder,

02:16.050 --> 02:19.050
I have the right to appoint my own Green Jade Guardian.

02:19.079 --> 02:20.050
Miss Yun Weishan

02:20.380 --> 02:22.240
is now my new Green Jade Guardian.

02:23.560 --> 02:26.560
There's no rule that women can't be guardians, right?

02:28.220 --> 02:29.550
Women can be guardians.

02:30.180 --> 02:33.510
But I'd like to see Miss Yun's Green Jade Guardian bracelet.

02:38.480 --> 02:40.590
I was in a hurry to enter the back hill for the trial

02:40.590 --> 02:41.350
so I didn’t have time to...

02:41.350 --> 02:41.980
Here.

02:46.030 --> 02:47.760
Before entering the back hill,

02:47.980 --> 02:49.490
I have something for you.

02:55.790 --> 02:56.760
If anyone asks,

02:57.730 --> 03:00.990
tell them you're the Sword Wielder's Green Jade Guardian.

03:01.150 --> 03:01.880
Don't worry.

03:02.530 --> 03:05.190
I will risk my life to protect the Sword Wielder.

03:08.430 --> 03:09.490
You don't trust me?

03:10.500 --> 03:11.900
People can't be trusted.

03:12.920 --> 03:14.620
What about personal interest?

03:14.620 --> 03:15.750
Can that be trusted?

03:16.510 --> 03:17.970
Out of personal interest,

03:18.050 --> 03:20.980
I will also risk my life to protect the Sword Wielder.

03:21.290 --> 03:22.220
Without him,

03:23.440 --> 03:24.970
I won't have a place to stay.

03:39.510 --> 03:40.970
I'll prepare a guest room.

03:41.350 --> 03:42.790
Please follow me, Miss Yun Weishan.

03:42.790 --> 03:43.310
No need.

03:46.300 --> 03:48.500
I'll stay in the same room with Miss Yun.

03:49.640 --> 03:51.100
This is against the rules.

03:52.140 --> 03:54.170
Yun Weishan is my fiancée.

03:55.210 --> 03:56.300
My father passed away

03:56.300 --> 03:57.300
and I am mourning.

03:58.210 --> 04:00.870
That's why the wedding date is being postponed.

04:24.260 --> 04:25.860
This is Jin Fan's green jade.

04:26.620 --> 04:27.860
After you left,

04:28.370 --> 04:30.150
Jin Fan has been distracted.

04:31.170 --> 04:32.430
Under Elder Young Miss

04:32.640 --> 04:33.770
and my questioning,

04:33.780 --> 04:35.510
he finally told us that

04:36.200 --> 04:38.960
the Trial of the Three Realms is extremely dangerous.

04:38.960 --> 04:39.590
So,

04:39.980 --> 04:42.380
Eldest Young Miss and I forced him to help me

04:42.380 --> 04:43.909
to find you at the back hill.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.230
I can imagine

04:46.300 --> 04:48.700
how the Gong Zishang interrogated Jin Fan.

04:49.940 --> 04:51.390
Jin Fan was unwilling to

04:51.390 --> 04:54.320
to violate the ancestral precept of the Gong family.

04:54.540 --> 04:55.550
But I can't allow you to

04:55.550 --> 04:57.680
encounter any mishap at the back hill.

04:58.350 --> 05:01.010
So I forced him to compete with me in martial arts

05:01.470 --> 05:02.270
to prove that

05:02.270 --> 05:04.400
I am able to protect Young Master Ziyu.

05:04.980 --> 05:06.410
Why can't you allow me to

05:06.550 --> 05:07.810
encounter any mishap?

05:16.990 --> 05:17.990
What do you think?

05:19.360 --> 05:20.560
All right, all right.

05:22.640 --> 05:24.240
So you lost the competition,

05:24.720 --> 05:26.390
and colluded with Gong Zishang to cheat

05:26.390 --> 05:27.720
to force Jin Fan, right?

05:28.660 --> 05:29.100
No.

05:30.890 --> 05:31.590
I won.

05:33.800 --> 05:34.730
You beat Jin Fan?

05:36.500 --> 05:38.180
Maybe he felt guilty,

05:38.200 --> 05:39.750
and because of my identity,

05:40.120 --> 05:41.770
he went lenient on me.

05:43.490 --> 05:46.420
But he still refuses to acknowledge that I am your...

05:48.300 --> 05:49.570
your wife.

05:50.600 --> 05:53.350
He thinks I'm not qualified to enter the back hill.

05:53.350 --> 05:54.210
It was at the end

05:54.450 --> 05:56.780
that he came up with this worst-case-scenario plan

05:56.780 --> 05:58.780
and gave me his green jade bracelet,

05:59.230 --> 06:00.560
and asked me to come here

06:00.740 --> 06:02.940
as the Green Jade Guardian in his stead.

06:04.190 --> 06:05.270
So now,

06:05.510 --> 06:07.150
are you the Sword Wielder's wife

06:07.150 --> 06:08.550
or a Green Jade Guardian?

06:10.580 --> 06:12.840
We haven't officially kowtowed to heaven and earth,

06:12.840 --> 06:15.240
of course I'm not the Sword Wielder's wife.

06:21.570 --> 06:23.430
Can you, the Green Jade Guardian,

06:23.600 --> 06:24.550
please help me

06:24.910 --> 06:27.520
heat up the cold medicinal porridge over there?

06:27.520 --> 06:29.120
My wife is hungry.

07:19.150 --> 07:20.300
I want to light this room

07:20.300 --> 07:21.630
a little more brighter.

07:22.670 --> 07:23.390
In this way,

07:24.120 --> 07:25.580
I can see you more clearly.

07:37.520 --> 07:38.180
Let me do it.

07:38.950 --> 07:39.680
You sit down.

07:41.430 --> 07:42.290
I can't do that.

07:43.470 --> 07:44.550
I'm afraid of the cold.

07:44.550 --> 07:45.950
It's warm near the stove.

07:49.280 --> 07:50.090
Nonsense.

08:20.560 --> 08:21.020
Sister,

08:22.500 --> 08:23.570
do you have a wish?

08:28.650 --> 08:29.270
No.

08:31.020 --> 08:32.750
There's nothing you want to do?

08:34.700 --> 08:36.419
You need a longing

08:37.750 --> 08:39.549
to get through the hardship now.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.580
If I have to say something,

08:48.920 --> 08:50.970
I just want to live a normal life.

08:53.140 --> 08:54.740
Wash clothes for my beloved,

08:55.550 --> 08:56.610
and make porridge.

08:57.670 --> 08:59.970
Light a lamp in an obscure corner

09:00.620 --> 09:01.750
of a snowcapped hill

09:02.220 --> 09:03.280
and guard the fire.

09:04.660 --> 09:05.940
Living a quiet

09:07.030 --> 09:08.320
and peaceful life.

09:36.270 --> 09:37.730
Why are you laughing at me?

09:37.950 --> 09:38.880
I'm not.

09:39.770 --> 09:40.810
I just didn't expect

09:40.810 --> 09:42.020
you to be so girlish.

09:45.160 --> 09:45.820
Go to sleep.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.050
Have a taste.

10:20.750 --> 10:21.480
Is it bitter?

10:26.060 --> 10:26.630
No.

10:47.930 --> 10:48.730
In the future,

10:50.050 --> 10:51.310
I won't let you suffer.

11:57.840 --> 11:58.960
With a peacock,

11:59.630 --> 12:00.810
light wings.

12:08.380 --> 12:09.810
A heart like a hefty rock,

12:10.990 --> 12:12.450
bury it deep in the forest.

12:16.190 --> 12:16.790
Sir,

12:17.090 --> 12:19.350
the front hill delivered an urgent report.

12:19.350 --> 12:19.950
What is it?

12:21.400 --> 12:22.180
Elder Yue...

12:24.920 --> 12:25.980
was assassinated.

12:35.630 --> 12:39.560
[Sword Wielder is injured
Elder is dead
The dead is silent, the murderer is Anonymous. In kindness, the mastermind is Wufeng.]

12:39.560 --> 12:42.190
[Wufeng]

12:59.430 --> 13:00.490
Young Master Ziyu,

13:01.150 --> 13:02.900
we received an urgent report from the front hill.

13:02.900 --> 13:04.560
You must return immediately.

13:05.580 --> 13:06.640
Are you kidding me?

13:07.710 --> 13:08.990
The trial is not over yet.

13:08.990 --> 13:11.050
If I go back now, it means I've failed.

13:11.790 --> 13:12.790
Who sent the news?

13:12.790 --> 13:14.300
Was it Gong Yuanzhi or Gong Shangjue?

13:14.300 --> 13:15.160
Sword Wielder,

13:16.050 --> 13:17.450
this concerns the trial,

13:17.470 --> 13:19.000
please deliberate over it.

13:24.470 --> 13:25.350
What happened?

13:27.460 --> 13:28.190
Elder Yue...

13:29.820 --> 13:32.350
Elder Yue was assassinated and has passed on.

14:13.950 --> 14:16.030
Gong Hongyu gave birth to a son

14:16.030 --> 14:17.390
as loyal as he was.

14:19.080 --> 14:20.130
I hope

14:20.830 --> 14:21.340
he won't end up

14:21.340 --> 14:22.820
like his father.

14:32.150 --> 14:33.510
The Gong family's Sword Wielder's existence

14:33.510 --> 14:34.910
is to protect the family.

14:35.710 --> 14:36.610
A family member passed away,

14:36.610 --> 14:38.740
yet I'm supposed to focus on the trial.

14:38.760 --> 14:39.960
I'm unable to do that.

14:41.020 --> 14:42.030
Even if I succeed,

14:42.050 --> 14:43.050
what's the point?

14:44.580 --> 14:47.410
If I don't care about the life and death of my people,

14:47.410 --> 14:48.870
there's no need for me to be

14:48.970 --> 14:50.100
this Sword Wielder.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.850
To live for the Gong family,

14:55.600 --> 14:57.070
and to die for the Gong family.

14:57.070 --> 14:58.000
I look forward to

14:58.230 --> 15:00.510
the day you become a real Sword Wielder.

15:01.100 --> 15:01.910
At that time,

15:02.260 --> 15:04.030
I will help you put on the Sword Wielder robe.

15:04.030 --> 15:05.110
Ziyu told me

15:05.110 --> 15:07.630
he has read all the medical books he asked for.

15:07.630 --> 15:08.660
These are all new.

15:11.500 --> 15:12.450
Ziyu...

15:13.980 --> 15:16.060
I hope everything goes well for you.

15:17.740 --> 15:24.000
[Lasting Prosperity]

15:45.140 --> 15:46.670
The murderer is Anonymous.

15:47.190 --> 15:48.650
The mastermind is Wufeng.

15:52.440 --> 15:53.710
I told you

15:53.950 --> 15:56.350
that the Wufeng assassin was someone else.

15:56.360 --> 15:57.900
Housekeeper Jia was framed

15:58.110 --> 15:59.260
and killed.

16:02.350 --> 16:03.360
Who said

16:04.060 --> 16:06.860
there can only be one Wufeng spy in the Gong family?

16:08.180 --> 16:09.400
Wufeng has

16:09.910 --> 16:11.540
always been cautious.

16:12.410 --> 16:14.340
Unless they are highly confident,

16:14.790 --> 16:16.520
they won't take action easily.

16:18.070 --> 16:19.870
Young Master Shangjue is right.

16:20.260 --> 16:22.080
If they were weak in numbers,

16:22.510 --> 16:24.970
Wufeng wouldn't expose themselves easily,

16:26.820 --> 16:28.460
leaving a blood message

16:29.150 --> 16:30.520
to leave Wufeng's name.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.710
It's more like

16:34.600 --> 16:35.990
a declaration.

16:46.370 --> 16:48.030
Thank you for sending me back.

16:48.860 --> 16:50.210
The Gong residence is not safe tonight.

16:50.210 --> 16:52.150
Miss Yun, please don't wander around.

16:52.150 --> 16:53.210
Please rest early.

16:53.980 --> 16:54.580
All right.

17:27.089 --> 17:27.780
Other than

17:28.470 --> 17:30.020
a paper-thin blade slit on his nect,

17:30.020 --> 17:31.710
there are no other wounds

17:32.270 --> 17:33.070
on Elder Yue's

17:33.200 --> 17:34.250
body.

17:38.110 --> 17:39.180
Ask the people in the clinic

17:39.180 --> 17:40.640
to examine closely again.

17:40.980 --> 17:41.400
Yes.

17:51.820 --> 17:52.800
Did the guards

17:53.450 --> 17:55.110
not notice anything unusual?

17:55.830 --> 17:57.520
You came too late.

17:59.900 --> 18:01.520
We've checked carefully.

18:03.150 --> 18:04.750
Elder Yue ordered the guards

18:05.330 --> 18:07.290
to be removed personally tonight.

18:08.990 --> 18:11.440
The guards found out only that Elder Yue

18:12.750 --> 18:14.950
was murdered when a thick scent of blood

18:15.190 --> 18:17.390
started coming out of the Meeting Hall.

18:17.670 --> 18:18.370
Besides,

18:19.420 --> 18:22.150
Elder Yue left his personal Yellow Jade Guardian

18:22.890 --> 18:24.190
in the Guardian Camp.

18:24.730 --> 18:27.970
Elder Yue was meeting someone so mysteriously.

18:30.030 --> 18:32.690
It seems like he was meeting someone important.

18:50.450 --> 18:51.240
What is this?

18:52.460 --> 18:55.390
I found some embroidered handkerchiefs from your closet.

18:55.390 --> 18:56.300
I like them.

18:56.570 --> 18:57.970
I'll bring it back later.

18:58.250 --> 19:00.180
Don't look through my stuff again.

19:03.970 --> 19:05.570
You're afraid that I'll find

19:05.990 --> 19:08.120
the secret that you're hiding, right?

19:08.590 --> 19:09.850
Does Elder Yue's death

19:10.920 --> 19:12.520
have anything to do with you?

19:14.770 --> 19:16.280
I wanted to ask you that.

19:18.310 --> 19:19.440
I was at the back hill

19:20.090 --> 19:21.440
with Gong Ziyu.

19:23.470 --> 19:25.010
You're really something.

19:25.940 --> 19:28.360
You really went to the back hill.

19:29.650 --> 19:30.330
It seems

19:30.680 --> 19:33.250
you don’t need to suffer from the Fortnight Flies.

19:33.250 --> 19:34.880
What went on with Elder Yue?

19:36.950 --> 19:39.010
There was a message left on the scene.

19:39.260 --> 19:40.790
The murderer is Anonymous.

19:41.140 --> 19:42.600
The mastermind is Wufeng.

19:44.010 --> 19:45.270
It's Anonymous again.

19:49.090 --> 19:52.090
Looks like Housekeeper Jia wasn't really Anonymous.

19:52.320 --> 19:54.650
Anonymous is still in the Gong residence.

19:54.710 --> 19:55.710
They're not dead.

19:57.480 --> 19:59.520
Anonymous has been hiding for so many years.

19:59.520 --> 20:01.180
They have always been silent.

20:01.370 --> 20:03.300
Why did they suddenly take action?

20:04.790 --> 20:05.650
It seems

20:05.750 --> 20:07.950
it wasn't what Anonymous intended for.

20:09.210 --> 20:10.740
It seems he was threatened.

20:15.890 --> 20:16.790
Killing people in

20:16.790 --> 20:19.050
the Gong residence recklessly like this

20:19.780 --> 20:22.670
will only cause the Gong family to heighten their security.

20:22.670 --> 20:23.290
With that,

20:24.740 --> 20:27.600
it will only be more difficult for us to take action.

20:28.360 --> 20:30.490
In addition to that, we are outsiders.

20:30.960 --> 20:33.820
It's even more difficult for us to not be suspected.

20:35.060 --> 20:36.060
Not necessarily.

20:36.960 --> 20:38.440
I think the Gong family

20:39.050 --> 20:41.850
will point the blame to their own people this time.

20:44.750 --> 20:47.040
There was a sword wound on his throat.

20:47.630 --> 20:48.830
The wound is very thin

20:49.390 --> 20:50.540
and clean.

20:51.110 --> 20:53.320
He died from a sword slit close to him.

20:55.360 --> 20:57.110
For this person to be able to get so close to him

20:57.110 --> 20:58.910
without him being precautious,

20:59.430 --> 21:01.540
Elder Yue must trust them very much.

21:02.810 --> 21:03.460
Or,

21:04.940 --> 21:06.270
he loves them very much.

21:07.790 --> 21:09.120
I'm afraid this person

21:09.600 --> 21:11.950
has been planning this for many years

21:12.620 --> 21:13.680
in the Gong family.

21:15.850 --> 21:16.710
Their position

21:17.490 --> 21:19.620
has to be higher than Housekeeper Jia.

21:20.280 --> 21:22.230
They have deceived us for many years.

21:22.230 --> 21:23.690
They must be very skilled.

21:24.250 --> 21:25.880
We must be more careful.

21:27.190 --> 21:29.000
It's just a Wufeng dog.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.530
They dare not come out into the light,

21:31.530 --> 21:32.930
and only hide in the dark,

21:33.870 --> 21:35.470
doing dirty things

21:35.690 --> 21:37.780
in secret.

21:39.030 --> 21:40.760
But don't treat wolves as dogs.

21:41.350 --> 21:42.610
If you take it lightly,

21:43.410 --> 21:44.410
Elder Yue’s death

21:44.560 --> 21:45.820
will just be a prelude!

21:46.460 --> 21:48.520
Are you threatening me or cursing me?

21:49.270 --> 21:49.810
Why?

21:50.520 --> 21:52.030
I'll be the next target?

21:52.730 --> 21:54.260
Whether it's a wolf or a dog,

21:55.560 --> 21:57.590
he will show his claws.

22:00.770 --> 22:03.170
The Gong residence is heavily guarded now.

22:04.080 --> 22:06.540
It's only a matter of time to find Anonymous.

22:06.840 --> 22:09.240
The messier the Gong family is, the better.

22:09.550 --> 22:12.880
It's better for us to finish the mission while it's chaotic.

22:14.850 --> 22:16.810
With such a big thing happening,

22:17.190 --> 22:19.540
can Gong Ziyu's trial continue?

22:20.490 --> 22:22.620
Why don't you go to the front hill with me?

22:22.620 --> 22:23.550
You don't have to

22:24.300 --> 22:25.700
worry about my business.

22:37.490 --> 22:38.420
Your body is hot.

22:40.690 --> 22:41.750
It's starting for you too?

22:41.750 --> 22:43.810
They are eggs of Bone-Gnawing Flies.

22:44.690 --> 22:46.820
It's also called the Fortnight Flies.

22:48.580 --> 22:50.510
After the egg hatches in your body,

22:51.240 --> 22:53.700
your body temperature will gradually rise.

22:54.760 --> 22:56.890
If you don't take the antidote in time,

22:57.540 --> 22:58.470
your organs

22:59.580 --> 23:01.240
will all be burned inside out.

23:06.910 --> 23:08.310
This is a tea infused with

23:08.590 --> 23:09.730
calcite

23:10.160 --> 23:10.940
and viola.

23:12.110 --> 23:13.970
I got these herbs from the clinic.

23:15.290 --> 23:16.950
It can't detoxify the toxins,

23:17.240 --> 23:18.100
but at least,

23:18.340 --> 23:19.670
it can relieve the pain.

23:21.070 --> 23:21.690
Drink it.

23:21.940 --> 23:22.670
I'm leaving.

23:22.980 --> 23:23.710
You came here

23:25.620 --> 23:26.740
to give me this?

23:34.660 --> 23:35.410
Gentian.

23:38.470 --> 23:39.870
Add a portion of gentian.

23:43.350 --> 23:44.110
Thank you.

24:04.820 --> 24:06.620
Elder Yue is a highly ranked man.

24:06.710 --> 24:09.030
He won’t meet a lowly person alone.

24:09.630 --> 24:10.870
So our top priority

24:11.520 --> 24:12.760
is to investigate

24:12.930 --> 24:14.460
all the people above the rank of a Housekeeper

24:14.460 --> 24:15.720
in the Gong residence.

24:17.470 --> 24:20.640
Although the internal affairs have always been the duty of the Yu Lineage,

24:20.640 --> 24:21.640
Young Master Ziyu

24:22.050 --> 24:24.870
is taking the Trial of the Three Realms at the back hill.

24:24.870 --> 24:25.990
I’ll take charge of

24:26.760 --> 24:28.620
the investigation of Anonymous.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.590
After your investigation last time,

24:30.590 --> 24:32.980
you said Housekeeper Jia was the Wufeng spy.

24:32.980 --> 24:33.660
This time,

24:34.260 --> 24:35.590
how can I leave it to you?

24:35.740 --> 24:36.460
Gong Ziyu,

24:37.260 --> 24:39.910
did you not pass the trial at the back hill

24:40.470 --> 24:42.530
and are too embarrassed to admit to it

24:42.710 --> 24:43.380
so

24:44.660 --> 24:46.620
you're trying to avoid the trial

24:47.390 --> 24:50.150
using the investigation of Anonymous as an excuse?

24:50.150 --> 24:52.430
Since Ziyu is here now,

24:53.270 --> 24:54.020
seems like

24:54.610 --> 24:57.420
he passed the first trial successfully.

25:04.110 --> 25:04.660
No.

25:06.280 --> 25:07.480
This is an emergency–

25:07.710 --> 25:08.960
According to the ancestral precept of the Gong family,

25:08.960 --> 25:10.220
once the trial begins,

25:10.570 --> 25:11.500
if it stops,

25:11.610 --> 25:13.410
it will be considered a failure.

25:13.510 --> 25:14.970
You have failed the trial.

25:18.010 --> 25:20.360
The Trial Keeper has already reported

25:21.220 --> 25:22.400
to me.

25:23.280 --> 25:24.610
According to the rules,

25:25.090 --> 25:27.060
it should be considered a failure.

25:29.870 --> 25:30.560
But

25:31.300 --> 25:33.750
the Sword Wielder found out that Elder Yue had been murdered.

25:33.750 --> 25:34.540
After knowing about that,

25:34.540 --> 25:37.670
even though he knew that he will fail the trial if he left,

25:37.670 --> 25:41.200
he still returned to the front hill without much consideration

25:41.590 --> 25:43.630
to settle the affairs of the Gong family.

25:43.630 --> 25:45.220
This means that Ziyu

25:45.500 --> 25:47.580
always puts the safety of the people

25:48.020 --> 25:48.900
first.

25:49.670 --> 25:50.200
So,

25:50.750 --> 25:52.780
on behalf of the back hill's Xue Lineage,

25:52.780 --> 25:54.870
I will allow the Sword Wielder to return

25:54.870 --> 25:56.570
and continue the trial.

26:00.270 --> 26:00.940
Elder Hua,

26:01.610 --> 26:02.560
do you agree?

26:05.130 --> 26:06.700
Since Elder Xue said so,

26:08.230 --> 26:09.910
I'll say no more.

26:11.140 --> 26:12.340
But please remember,

26:12.850 --> 26:14.380
everyone in the Gong family

26:14.580 --> 26:17.390
made changes to the ancestral precept for Gong Ziyue.

26:17.390 --> 26:19.390
If something happens in the future,

26:19.710 --> 26:21.440
this will be a reference point.

26:22.760 --> 26:24.290
The rules of the Gong family

26:24.410 --> 26:26.800
are no longer an untouchable iron law.

26:27.790 --> 26:30.050
As long as it's beneficial to our people,

26:30.330 --> 26:32.440
the old rules of the Gong family

26:33.730 --> 26:35.200
should be amended

26:37.110 --> 26:38.760
and defied accordingly.

26:44.150 --> 26:45.300
With something as sudden

26:45.300 --> 26:46.960
happening to the Gong family,

26:48.150 --> 26:48.980
I'm wondering

26:50.770 --> 26:52.720
if we should pause Ziyu's trial

26:53.110 --> 26:54.170
for the time being.

26:54.310 --> 26:56.590
It's because there have been frequent happenings at the Gong family,

26:56.590 --> 26:58.050
with the impending storm,

26:58.680 --> 27:00.420
we must select the

27:00.540 --> 27:02.510
Sword Wielder candidate as soon as possible

27:02.510 --> 27:04.240
to lead the overall situation.

27:05.510 --> 27:07.040
I believe that it won't take

27:07.510 --> 27:08.550
Ziyu too much time

27:08.570 --> 27:10.630
to pass the Trial of the Three Realms.

27:11.290 --> 27:12.230
Before that,

27:12.750 --> 27:13.540
I will

27:13.820 --> 27:15.110
lead my subordinates

27:15.590 --> 27:17.120
to investigate Anonymous.

27:17.890 --> 27:19.550
Along with Young Master Ziyu,

27:20.570 --> 27:22.790
the future Sword Wilder, at the back hill,

27:22.790 --> 27:25.390
we will work together on internal and external affairs

27:25.390 --> 27:28.750
to protect the Gong family's safety to our best capabilities.

27:28.750 --> 27:30.100
If we work together,

27:31.070 --> 27:33.330
there will definitely be a good outcome.

27:33.370 --> 27:33.820
Right?

27:36.110 --> 27:36.550
Yes.

27:39.230 --> 27:39.710
But

27:41.870 --> 27:44.650
Young Master Shangjue set a time limit for me to complete the trial.

27:44.650 --> 27:46.710
For the investigation of this trace,

27:47.030 --> 27:48.760
we should also set a time limit.

27:49.710 --> 27:51.710
As long as Anonymous is still alive,

27:52.110 --> 27:52.950
no one in the Gong family

27:52.950 --> 27:53.850
can be in peace.

27:54.060 --> 27:54.680
Ten days.

27:56.690 --> 27:58.230
Ten days will be the time limit.

27:58.230 --> 28:00.360
I will find out Anonymous's identity.

28:01.010 --> 28:01.920
If I fail,

28:03.140 --> 28:04.940
then everyone in the Jue Lineage

28:05.920 --> 28:08.910
will obey the order of the Sword Wielder in the future.

28:08.910 --> 28:10.450
But if I am able to capture Anoynmous

28:10.450 --> 28:11.790
within ten days,

28:12.390 --> 28:13.390
and Gong Ziyu

28:14.190 --> 28:16.190
still hasn't passed the first test,

28:18.110 --> 28:18.920
I hope

28:20.070 --> 28:22.210
everyone in the Gong family

28:23.320 --> 28:25.270
can choose a new Sword Wielder

28:26.520 --> 28:27.920
between me and Gong Ziyu.

28:29.670 --> 28:30.780
As the elders said,

28:32.900 --> 28:35.640
the interests for our people are above everything.

28:35.640 --> 28:37.500
The position of the Sword Wielder

28:38.710 --> 28:39.870
should be in the hands of someone capable.

28:39.870 --> 28:41.350
But the rules of the Gong family

28:41.350 --> 28:44.610
have never allowed for a re-election of the Sword Wielder.

28:49.910 --> 28:54.110
Since the ancestral precept of the Gong family can be changed for Gong Ziyu,

28:54.370 --> 28:56.830
then it can be changed for me too.

28:59.610 --> 29:01.420
If the elders are

29:02.230 --> 29:03.300
so biased,

29:04.630 --> 29:06.430
I'll just leave the Gong family.

29:08.770 --> 29:10.230
In the vast martial world,

29:11.540 --> 29:14.230
there will be a place for me.

29:17.470 --> 29:18.610
I'm not yet twenty,

29:19.180 --> 29:20.110
and is yet of age.

29:20.520 --> 29:22.990
Naturally, I am not qualified to fight for the position of the Sword Wielder.

29:22.990 --> 29:24.520
But if the Gong family rules

29:24.550 --> 29:26.930
can be changed for Gong Ziyu,

29:27.620 --> 29:29.590
then the same can be done for me too.

29:31.950 --> 29:33.480
But as the elders have said,

29:33.550 --> 29:36.480
we should prioritize the interests of the Gong family.

29:36.480 --> 29:38.000
My brother Gong Shangjue

29:38.200 --> 29:39.860
has already passed the trial.

29:40.680 --> 29:42.390
If he can find out the

29:42.410 --> 29:43.940
Wufeng spy within ten days,

29:44.030 --> 29:46.000
I will support Shangjue

29:46.550 --> 29:49.010
and not fight for this position against him.

29:49.970 --> 29:50.610
After all,

29:51.370 --> 29:52.900
one should be not shameless

29:54.570 --> 29:56.030
to live in this world.

29:58.430 --> 29:59.050
I know.

30:00.250 --> 30:01.310
I don't deserve it.

30:14.430 --> 30:15.370
It happened

30:15.630 --> 30:16.710
too suddenly.

30:18.540 --> 30:19.240
Everything

30:20.520 --> 30:22.250
can only be done the simple way.

30:23.390 --> 30:23.920
Brother.

30:24.710 --> 30:25.540
Who is this?

30:27.410 --> 30:28.670
You Young Masters

30:29.620 --> 30:31.200
are still too young.

30:33.220 --> 30:34.950
There is a change in the elders.

30:35.350 --> 30:37.480
This is the first time you are meeting.

30:37.840 --> 30:38.920
Elder Yue died.

30:40.450 --> 30:41.790
According to the rules,

30:42.620 --> 30:44.020
the position of the elder

30:44.310 --> 30:46.910
is to be inherited by someone of the Yue family.

30:48.220 --> 30:49.220
Young Master Yue.

30:55.860 --> 30:57.120
That Young Master Yue,

30:57.470 --> 30:59.110
looks not much older than me.

30:59.860 --> 31:01.290
Yet, he's an elder now.

31:03.030 --> 31:05.060
There's an age restriction to becoming a Sword Wielder.

31:05.060 --> 31:07.190
Is there not one for becoming an elder?

31:10.100 --> 31:10.630
Brother.

31:11.310 --> 31:12.400
Who is he?

31:13.830 --> 31:15.560
He's someone you must respect.

31:37.330 --> 31:38.140
Lady Wuji?

31:39.390 --> 31:40.390
What a rare guest.

31:55.510 --> 31:57.630
There was an accident in the Gong family.

31:57.630 --> 31:59.760
The whole hill is under siege at night.

32:00.330 --> 32:01.730
If there's nothing else,

32:02.510 --> 32:03.830
Lady Wuji, please don't...

32:03.830 --> 32:04.910
I remember

32:08.310 --> 32:09.970
Gong Ziyue's background now.

32:14.870 --> 32:16.130
It's snowing and late.

32:16.340 --> 32:17.400
It's cold outside.

32:18.230 --> 32:19.070
Lady Wuji,

32:19.930 --> 32:22.130
let's go to the Jue Lineage to talk more.

32:22.230 --> 32:23.360
There are many spies

32:23.690 --> 32:25.020
and gossip will spread.

32:26.230 --> 32:27.630
I'll take a walk with you.

32:28.050 --> 32:28.540
Well,

32:29.340 --> 32:31.740
I'll take Your Ladyship back to Yu Lineage.

32:37.180 --> 32:40.440
[Jue]

32:40.520 --> 32:41.440
Every lady,

32:42.070 --> 32:43.800
from pregnancy to childbirth,

32:44.670 --> 32:45.590
will be taken care of

32:45.590 --> 32:47.650
by a personal doctor from the clinic.

32:49.420 --> 32:51.620
There will be records in the clinic too.

32:51.820 --> 32:54.010
I've read Lady Lan's medical records.

32:54.660 --> 32:56.320
It clearly states that it was a

32:56.320 --> 32:57.320
premature birth.

32:58.630 --> 33:00.230
The medical record was fake?

33:01.390 --> 33:02.520
The record was true,

33:03.250 --> 33:04.910
but the Sword Wielder had made

33:05.260 --> 33:06.790
changes to a few pages of it.

33:09.630 --> 33:10.440
I see.

33:11.320 --> 33:12.000
These pages

33:12.680 --> 33:13.940
are with you.

33:16.090 --> 33:17.110
You are smart.

33:19.750 --> 33:20.840
But You won't

33:21.560 --> 33:22.690
give it to me easily.

33:24.180 --> 33:25.230
I have my own way

33:25.390 --> 33:26.650
to make her take it out.

33:29.990 --> 33:32.190
Yong Master Yuanzhi is good at poisons.

33:32.610 --> 33:33.460
To be honest,

33:34.420 --> 33:35.790
I'm a little scared.

33:37.590 --> 33:40.070
As the concubine of the former Sword Wielder,

33:40.070 --> 33:43.000
I am only considered half a member of the Gong family.

33:43.200 --> 33:43.910
My life

33:44.940 --> 33:45.740
is worthless.

33:48.430 --> 33:49.500
But to verify

33:49.540 --> 33:51.000
the identity of Gong Ziyu,

33:51.990 --> 33:54.450
just a few pages of old paper won't be enough.

33:55.020 --> 33:57.020
If I can be presented as the witness,

33:57.560 --> 33:59.620
with the medical record as evidence,

34:00.460 --> 34:02.260
I can definitely help your case.

34:04.870 --> 34:06.530
Yuanzhi is young and playful.

34:06.710 --> 34:07.710
He has no manners.

34:08.350 --> 34:10.010
Lady Wuji, please don't mind.

34:11.639 --> 34:13.429
It's great that you can

34:13.980 --> 34:15.040
remember the past.

34:16.350 --> 34:17.710
But I'm curious...

34:19.100 --> 34:20.940
what changed your mind?

34:21.870 --> 34:22.590
After all,

34:23.480 --> 34:24.639
you treat Ziyu

34:25.110 --> 34:26.340
as your own child.

34:28.679 --> 34:30.270
I've been here for too long.

34:33.949 --> 34:36.080
So long I'm tired of everything here.

34:39.159 --> 34:40.889
The former Sword Wielder died,

34:41.699 --> 34:44.100
and the Gong family is embroidered in mess.

34:45.340 --> 34:46.219
Staying here

34:46.820 --> 34:48.270
will not give me peace.

34:51.150 --> 34:53.280
I want to stay away from this bloodshed

34:55.230 --> 34:57.360
and find a peaceful place in this world

34:59.310 --> 35:00.840
to spend the rest of my life.

35:03.870 --> 35:05.800
Yu Lineage is just ahead.

35:07.420 --> 35:08.620
Please stop here.

35:13.820 --> 35:14.880
The night is rough.

35:16.510 --> 35:19.370
Please don't take the wrong path, Young Master Jue.

35:50.710 --> 35:51.500
I don't believe there can be

35:51.500 --> 35:53.830
that many Wufeng spies in the Gong family.

35:54.220 --> 35:55.820
Gong Shangjue must be lying.

35:55.990 --> 35:57.190
But the token is real.

35:57.280 --> 35:58.620
There's also that blood message as evidence.

35:58.620 --> 36:00.220
Housekeeper Jia did die too.

36:01.230 --> 36:02.890
What is Gong Shangjue's goal?

36:03.840 --> 36:04.570
To threaten?

36:05.700 --> 36:06.300
Threaten?

36:07.290 --> 36:08.910
To cause chaos in the Gong family

36:08.910 --> 36:10.180
and have people make wild guesses.

36:10.180 --> 36:11.580
Who said there can only be

36:11.750 --> 36:13.810
one Wufeng spy in the Gong residence?

36:14.860 --> 36:16.860
In fact, there is only one Wufeng spy

36:17.700 --> 36:19.300
in the whole Gong family.

36:19.750 --> 36:21.260
He's just bluffing

36:21.280 --> 36:22.130
to confuse us

36:23.210 --> 36:25.810
and cover up what happened to Housekeeper Jia,

36:26.310 --> 36:27.380
while creating

36:27.610 --> 36:29.740
the tense atmosphere of a strong enemy

36:30.240 --> 36:32.240
to stir things up in the Gong family.

36:33.590 --> 36:34.590
What does he want?

36:35.680 --> 36:37.480
He said everything in public.

36:38.070 --> 36:40.000
You still don't know what he wants?

36:41.470 --> 36:43.530
He wants to change the Sword Wielder.

36:45.550 --> 36:47.920
He wouldn't be so crazy as to kill an elder

36:48.330 --> 36:51.260
just because he wants to be the Sword Wielder, right?

36:57.850 --> 36:58.450
By the way,

36:59.250 --> 37:00.510
about the first trial,

37:03.270 --> 37:04.870
if I were you, I would ask Miss Yun

37:04.870 --> 37:06.000
to discuss about it.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.780
Jin Fan asked you to ask me?

37:14.550 --> 37:15.250
Yes.

37:15.780 --> 37:17.500
I was also confused by Jin Fan.

37:18.530 --> 37:19.600
He only told me

37:19.880 --> 37:21.790
the first trial is about internal skill

37:21.790 --> 37:22.920
and nothing else.

37:23.640 --> 37:24.570
Internal skill?

37:25.080 --> 37:25.510
Yes.

37:26.010 --> 37:27.340
He gave an obvious hint.

37:33.180 --> 37:34.520
But this Ice Pool

37:35.070 --> 37:37.000
has to be a test of water abilities.

37:42.470 --> 37:43.510
Since this trial

37:43.770 --> 37:46.170
is to select the successor,

37:46.870 --> 37:47.970
it doesn't seem reasonable

37:47.970 --> 37:49.630
to just test water abilities.

37:53.670 --> 37:54.400
Right.

38:00.650 --> 38:01.380
What is this?

38:02.350 --> 38:02.830
Oh.

38:03.350 --> 38:05.070
I went to the clinic to get medicine.

38:05.070 --> 38:06.830
I thought that you must have caught a cold

38:06.830 --> 38:08.150
in the Xue Lineage,

38:08.590 --> 38:09.600
so I asked the doctor

38:09.600 --> 38:12.260
to make some ginger herbal tea to warm your body.

38:12.290 --> 38:14.190
Remember to drink it while it's hot.

38:14.190 --> 38:15.710
Why did you go to the clinic to get medicine?

38:15.710 --> 38:17.110
Are you not feeling well?

38:20.390 --> 38:21.050
Miss Yun.

38:21.860 --> 38:23.980
These herbs are cold in nature.

38:25.140 --> 38:26.940
Although you are weak and heaty,

38:27.470 --> 38:29.530
remember not to have too much of this.

38:32.950 --> 38:34.010
Thank you, doctor.

38:35.940 --> 38:37.380
It's hot lately.

38:38.100 --> 38:39.310
I went to the doctor

38:39.430 --> 38:41.890
to make some herbal tea to calm down the heat.

38:42.240 --> 38:43.430
Are you worried

38:43.490 --> 38:44.420
about me?

38:51.830 --> 38:54.780
I saw the servants sending ice to the room.

38:55.170 --> 38:57.030
They said you wanted to practice.

38:58.190 --> 38:59.190
Don't mention it.

39:02.430 --> 39:05.360
I know you're worried about passing the trials soon,

39:05.740 --> 39:07.450
but don't be too anxious.

39:08.270 --> 39:09.600
Your body can't take it.

39:11.900 --> 39:12.630
Don't worry.

39:12.660 --> 39:13.380
I'm fine.

39:17.750 --> 39:19.060
I'll take my leave first.

39:19.060 --> 39:20.790
Remember to take the medicine.

39:21.070 --> 39:21.640
Yun.

39:23.390 --> 39:24.650
Won't you stay longer?

39:25.550 --> 39:26.130
Yun?

39:32.680 --> 39:33.360
Yun.

39:33.520 --> 39:34.780
Doesn't it sound good?

39:37.350 --> 39:38.230
It sounds

39:38.550 --> 39:40.150
like a cat's name.

39:41.820 --> 39:43.210
Cats are cute.

39:45.260 --> 39:45.970
Yun.

39:49.510 --> 39:50.070
Yun...

39:52.400 --> 39:53.020
I like it.

39:54.310 --> 39:55.240
What do you like?

39:56.910 --> 39:57.790
I like Yun.

40:03.880 --> 40:05.160
This name.

40:33.790 --> 40:34.320
Brother.

40:34.950 --> 40:35.830
You said you'd find the Wufeng Spy

40:35.830 --> 40:36.930
within ten days.

40:38.090 --> 40:39.350
How confident are you?

40:40.510 --> 40:42.040
What are you planning to do?

40:54.280 --> 40:55.210
Is something up?

40:57.990 --> 40:58.420
No.

41:01.790 --> 41:02.520
But I'm busy.

41:04.590 --> 41:06.720
I just want to spend more time with you.

41:06.910 --> 41:08.110
If you need anything,

41:08.150 --> 41:09.430
just let me do it.

41:34.050 --> 41:34.710
Bay flower?

41:35.910 --> 41:36.350
Yes.

41:37.680 --> 41:39.630
I saw you liked to light bay flower incense

41:39.630 --> 41:40.810
in the room,

41:41.290 --> 41:43.630
so I went to the clinic to get some bay leaves

41:43.630 --> 41:44.960
and made essential oil.

41:46.350 --> 41:48.010
My father is a civil official.

41:48.230 --> 41:49.270
He likes to

41:49.270 --> 41:52.160
add special essential oils of the Shangguan family into his inks.

41:52.160 --> 41:54.950
This helps distinguish the authenticity of the document.

41:54.950 --> 41:55.600
So,

41:56.450 --> 41:58.110
I also want to add some for you.

42:00.210 --> 42:01.850
It may not be of much use,

42:02.760 --> 42:04.190
but it is also good if

42:04.910 --> 42:07.300
you can be in a better mood

42:07.910 --> 42:08.910
when you smell it.

42:11.720 --> 42:12.410
Do you know

42:13.940 --> 42:15.170
why I like bay flower?

42:19.320 --> 42:20.980
The master who taught me music

42:20.990 --> 42:22.020
also taught me

42:22.430 --> 42:23.680
about flowers

42:24.030 --> 42:24.860
and medicine.

42:26.580 --> 42:27.720
Bay flower is a

42:28.300 --> 42:29.440
scary

42:30.990 --> 42:32.230
yet charming plant.

42:34.250 --> 42:35.520
It's flower meaning is

42:37.220 --> 42:37.880
to bewitch.

42:39.470 --> 42:40.020
Indeed.

42:41.460 --> 42:42.660
People often say

42:43.480 --> 42:44.220
bay flower

42:44.730 --> 42:45.690
is dangerous

42:46.480 --> 42:47.290
yet charming.

42:49.640 --> 42:51.170
It represents bewitching.

42:52.600 --> 42:54.400
But bay flower's flower meaning

42:55.500 --> 42:56.960
also represents victory.

42:58.990 --> 43:00.000
I'm stupid.

43:00.850 --> 43:02.380
Sorry for my incompetence.

43:05.030 --> 43:05.820
Bay flower,

43:06.520 --> 43:07.700
according to legend, has always been

43:07.700 --> 43:09.230
the medicine of longevity,

43:09.460 --> 43:10.470
and is rare

43:11.280 --> 43:12.740
and difficult to harvest.

43:13.510 --> 43:14.570
If I'm lucky enough

43:15.180 --> 43:16.740
to find the bay plant

43:17.030 --> 43:18.940
that Wu Gang planted

43:19.410 --> 43:20.940
in the Greater Han Lineage,

43:21.320 --> 43:22.980
no matter what is hung upon it,

43:23.340 --> 43:24.400
be it copper coins,

43:24.980 --> 43:26.350
gold, jade, or agate,

43:27.340 --> 43:29.200
it can be harvested indefinitely

43:30.000 --> 43:31.000
and make one rich.

43:32.630 --> 43:34.170
To be able to harvest a

43:34.300 --> 43:36.100
bay flower branch is no easy feat.

43:36.100 --> 43:36.790
So,

43:37.580 --> 43:39.730
people call the passing the imperial exam

43:39.730 --> 43:40.900
"harvesting bay."

43:43.710 --> 43:45.770
And some barbarians in the northwest

43:46.340 --> 43:47.510
like to

43:48.190 --> 43:50.680
weave bay flower branches

43:51.050 --> 43:51.920
into a crown

43:52.460 --> 43:54.950
and give it to the warriors who returned in triumph.

43:54.950 --> 43:55.590
So,

43:56.940 --> 43:57.550
bay flower

43:58.510 --> 43:59.710
represents victory.

44:03.150 --> 44:03.800
This is

44:04.540 --> 44:06.040
why I like bay flower.

44:11.350 --> 44:13.680
My recklessness got me to the right place.

44:15.610 --> 44:16.480
I thought

44:17.470 --> 44:18.550
Miss Shangguan

44:19.040 --> 44:20.840
can only cook and plant flowers.

44:21.350 --> 44:22.210
I didn't expect

44:23.470 --> 44:25.400
you are good at writing and ink too.

44:29.570 --> 44:30.640
From now on,

44:31.490 --> 44:33.690
don't worry too much about the kitchen.

44:34.010 --> 44:35.940
I will just have what I used to have.

44:36.660 --> 44:38.130
Being in the kitchen

44:39.240 --> 44:40.700
is a waste of your talents.

44:43.100 --> 44:44.950
If you don't like chicken and fish,

44:44.950 --> 44:46.420
I can change them to something else.

44:46.420 --> 44:47.680
I don't like it indeed.

44:54.550 --> 44:56.210
I don't like chicken and fish.

44:57.260 --> 44:59.460
Nor a garden full of plants and flowers.

45:08.350 --> 45:08.850
Then...

45:09.390 --> 45:10.670
why do you still allow me to do so–

45:10.670 --> 45:12.870
You have just arrived in the Jue Lineage

45:12.990 --> 45:14.900
and is eager to establish your prestige.

45:14.900 --> 45:16.070
It's inconvenient for me

45:16.070 --> 45:17.070
to humiliate you.

45:19.510 --> 45:21.490
I chose you myself,

45:23.060 --> 45:23.860
Jue Lineage's

45:24.110 --> 45:25.170
future missus.

45:27.190 --> 45:27.830
But,

45:29.800 --> 45:31.500
I hope you know your place.

45:32.790 --> 45:33.870
Know your place,

45:36.110 --> 45:37.710
and stay away from troubles.

45:39.910 --> 45:42.040
Nothing can escape your eyes.

45:44.310 --> 45:45.320
You're right.

45:47.170 --> 45:47.950
Did you

45:49.020 --> 45:50.620
go to the Yu Lineage just now?

45:54.110 --> 45:55.390
Sister Yun said

45:55.390 --> 45:57.350
she's going to teach me some needlework patterns.

45:57.350 --> 45:58.610
I learned a few of them.

45:58.670 --> 46:00.150
I wanted to show you.

46:00.150 --> 46:01.280
-No need.
-I like it.

46:02.550 --> 46:03.480
Go back and rest.

46:09.230 --> 46:09.720
Yes.

46:16.270 --> 46:18.470
You planted azaleas all over the garden

46:19.530 --> 46:20.930
and nothing else.

46:23.380 --> 46:24.230
Do you know

46:25.760 --> 46:27.420
the flower meaning of azalea?

46:34.510 --> 46:35.060
Yes.

46:37.300 --> 46:39.620
Why did you choose only azaleas?

46:40.770 --> 46:43.170
Because the flower meaning of azalea is...

46:44.330 --> 46:45.660
I belong to you forever.

46:46.790 --> 46:47.350
Gosh.

46:47.540 --> 46:49.010
You are so thoughtful.

46:49.350 --> 46:50.470
So romantic.

46:51.000 --> 46:51.720
I hope

46:51.750 --> 46:54.680
Young Master Shangjue can understand you feelings.

46:55.260 --> 46:57.590
Young Master Shangjue is well-educated,

46:58.170 --> 46:59.770
I'm sure he will understand.

47:06.310 --> 47:07.140
Leave later.

47:08.390 --> 47:09.920
Help me grind some more ink.

47:28.480 --> 47:30.280
Put Elder Yue’s memorial tablet

47:30.980 --> 47:33.240
in the ancestral hall of the Gong family.

47:33.250 --> 47:39.880
[Accumulated light]

47:40.600 --> 47:42.000
The mountain mist flows.

47:42.250 --> 47:43.310
We are going deeper

47:43.990 --> 47:44.920
into the winter.

48:24.750 --> 48:25.770
Don't use power.

48:26.540 --> 48:27.470
Don't use power.

48:28.590 --> 48:29.520
Don't use power.

48:40.110 --> 48:40.790
Sword Wielder,

48:40.790 --> 48:42.670
the ice you asked for is ready.

48:43.540 --> 48:44.060
Got it.

48:44.480 --> 48:45.280
You may leave.

49:03.700 --> 49:05.000
I believe that

49:05.360 --> 49:06.850
it won't take much time

49:06.870 --> 49:09.730
for Ziyu to complete the Trials of the Three Realms.

49:12.190 --> 49:14.190
To pick a new Sword Wielder

49:14.580 --> 49:15.980
between me and Gong Ziyu.

49:18.640 --> 49:20.500
The position of the Sword Wielder

49:20.580 --> 49:22.640
should be in the hands of the capable.

49:26.670 --> 49:28.870
If the pain of burning is too torturing,

49:29.900 --> 49:31.110
use these herbs

49:31.630 --> 49:32.890
and make them into tea.

49:34.260 --> 49:36.660
After taking it, channel your inner skill.

49:37.050 --> 49:38.290
Your inner skill,

49:38.310 --> 49:39.570
the Yunjin Heart Sutra

49:39.640 --> 49:41.400
is an extremely corroding

49:41.430 --> 49:42.580
yin magic.

49:43.110 --> 49:45.640
This internal skill will make your body cold.

49:45.830 --> 49:47.060
But it can help you

49:47.240 --> 49:50.700
fight against the burning pain caused by the Fortnight Flies.

49:52.080 --> 49:52.850
I got it.
